1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Coming home, one missing state ID can stall
a job, banking, and housing at the same time.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,600
Each task is manageable.
The order can derail everything.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:12,300
Pathfinder turns Confirmed Facts
into one explainable Route,

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,000
starting with the Action
unlocking the rest.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,100
When I mark it complete, the deterministic
Route Engine recalculates.

6
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:26,400
A new Focus Action appears
with three Actions and moved work.

7
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:30,100
The participant sees
what changed and why,

8
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:34,000
without yielding control
to an opaque recommendation.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,500
AI can propose information, but it cannot
make a Fact true or sequence the Route.

10
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:44,200
This transit-pass item
is still Proposed,

11
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:50,000
so the Focus Action stays unchanged
until the participant reviews it.

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,400
After I confirm it, the engine recomputes
only from Confirmed Facts

13
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:59,400
and records
a structured Reroute.

14
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:03,200
That boundary
is deliberate:

15
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:05,600
the participant controls the Facts;

16
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:08,000
the Route Engine controls sequencing
consistently and visibly.

17
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,200
I built Pathfinder end to end:
deterministic engine, API endpoints,

18
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:16,700
security boundaries, responsive experience,
and deployment.

19
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,800
Route History preserves
every change.

20
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:24,700
This is how I work: close to the problem,
accountable to the people using it,

21
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:30,000
and ready to turn Pathfinder
into a mission-aligned pilot.
